	      /*   X3. With each LRE, compute the least greater even
	         embedding level. */
	      /* 2. Explicit Overrides */
	      /*   X4. With each RLO, compute the least greater odd
	         embedding level. */
	      /*   X5. With each LRO, compute the least greater even
